B.amF=s(["It\u2019s not that deep","Actually showing up to things","Finish strong! Or don\u2019t. I still don\u2019t care"],t.s)
B.alq=s(["Just wrap it up","We won\u2019t drop you anymore! I think","The pledges are so excited to be done with you"],t.s)
