B.aqz=new A.bc(B.nE,[B.qa,B.a6R,"Through events like interview training, resume building, one-on-one mentorship, private company recruiting, Kappa Theta Pi Professional Development aims to prepare members for success in any technology-related career. We take pride in developing the tech leaders of the future."],t.EU)
